# November 24, 2026: Leavenworth, Fort Leavenworth and the country round it, Kansas (second pass).
# Fourteen places the first Leavenworth batch left out: Register-listed houses, two 1920s schools, a 1905 commercial
# block, a furniture factory, a rural cemetery, a museum in a house, two country houses, a farmstead and the earthwork
# of a Civil War battery on the fort.
# Facts from the linked sources only: National Register forms read in full text, the Kansas Historical Society's
# register search, Wikipedia read one article at a time.
